        "title": {
          "en": "Microsoft, OpenAI Amend Partnership, Remove AGI Clause",
          "zh": "微软与OpenAI修订合作，解除AGI条款"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI and Microsoft announced an amended agreement, simplifying their partnership and removing a clause that would have nullified Microsoft's commercial IP rights upon the achievement of AGI.",
          "zh": "OpenAI与微软宣布修正合作协议，简化了合作关系，并解除了原先规定在AGI实现时微软商业IP权利失效的条款。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The original partnership included a clause stating that Microsoft's commercial IP rights to OpenAI's technology would become null and void upon AGI achievement.",
            "This AGI clause was tracked on openai.com, appearing as early as July 22nd, 2019.",
            "The amended agreement aims to simplify the partnership, add long-term clarity, and support continued AI innovation at scale."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "原合作协议包含一项条款，规定在AGI实现时，微软对OpenAI技术的商业IP权利将失效。",
            "此AGI条款可追溯至2019年7月22日，并曾出现在openai.com上多年。",
            "修订后的协议旨在简化合作关系，增加长期清晰度，并支持大规模的持续AI创新。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The removal of the AGI clause provides Microsoft with long-term clarity regarding its commercial IP rights to OpenAI's technology. This amendment reflects an evolving framework for defining and managing intellectual property in the context of advanced AI development and commercialization.",
          "zh": "AGI条款的解除为微软在OpenAI技术上的商业IP权利提供了长期清晰度。此修订反映了在先进AI开发和商业化背景下，定义和管理知识产权的框架正在演变。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/index/next-phase-of-microsoft-partnership"
      },
      {
        "title": {
