            "OpenAI's hardware plans have previously involved rumors of launching earbuds.",
            "Industry analyst Ming-Chi Kuo issued a new note detailing the phone possibility.",
            "Potential collaborators for the phone project include MediaTek, Qualcomm, and Luxshare."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "OpenAI的硬件计划此前已有推出耳机的传闻。",
            "行业分析师郭明錤发布了关于手机可能性的新报告。",
            "该手机项目潜在的合作方包括联发科、高通和立讯精密。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "If materialized, an OpenAI-designed phone could shift the paradigm from apps to AI agents, potentially influencing future mobile device interfaces and functionality across the AI industry. This represents a move by a leading AI company into hardware.",
          "zh": "如果实现，OpenAI设计的手机可能将移动设备的范式从应用程序转向AI代理，从而影响AI行业未来的移动设备界面和功能。这标志着一家领先AI公司向硬件领域的拓展。"
        },
        "source": "TechCrunch (AI)",
        "link": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/27/openai-could-be-making-a-phone-with-ai-agents-replacing-apps/"
